tor/git/commits{/sha}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/froala/wysiwyg-editor/comments{/number}","issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/froala/wysiwyg-editor/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/froala/wysiwyg-editor/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/froala/wysiwyg-editor/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/froala/wysiwyg-editor/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/froala/wysiwyg-editor/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/froala/wysiwyg-editor/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/froala/wysiwyg-editor/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/froala/wysiwyg-editor/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/froala/wysiwyg-editor/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/froala/wysiwyg-editor/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/froala/wysiwyg-editor/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/froala/wysiwyg-editor/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/froala/wysiwyg-editor/deployments","created_at":"2014-02-03T00:08:51Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T09:54:09Z","pushed_at":"2025-11-19T08:46:02Z","git_url":"git://github.com/froala/wysiwyg-editor.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:froala/wysiwyg-editor.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/froala/wysiwyg-editor.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/froala/wysiwyg-editor","homepage":"https://www.froala.com/wysiwyg-editor","size":84136,"stargazers_count":5381,"watchers_count":5381,"language":"CSS","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":675,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":450,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["froala","javascript","rich-text-editor","wysiwyg","wysiwyg-editor","wysiwyg-html-editor"],"visibility":"public","forks":675,"open_issues":450,"watchers":5381,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"##### Expected behavior.\r\nWhen running my end-to-end tests with Cypress on a webpage including a Froala editor, the virtual keyboard inputs should behave as a real.\r\nIf the test run by Cypress inputs the following string in the Froala editor:\r\n```\r\nHello{enter}{enter}{enter}world!\r\n``` \r\nI intend to get 3 line feeds between `Hello` and `world!`, producing an inner HTML looking like this:\r\n```\r\n<p>Hello</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>world!</p>\r\n```\r\nThe result should look like following in an actual webpage:\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1412033/42279488-33c8c1f8-7f9e-11e8-86ad-fa3bb0e447d4.png)\r\n\r\n##### Actual behavior.\r\nThe virtual keyboard inputs does not work as expected, especially regarding the meta keys. In the specific case of the ENTER key, the expected line feed doesn't seem to be outputted at all on the Froala editor.\r\nStill considering the example string used before to be outputted by Cypress in the Froala Editor:\r\n```\r\nHello{enter}{enter}{enter}world!\r\n``` \r\nThen the result is actually looking like this:\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1412033/42279283-96b78534-7f9d-11e8-9313-adec92686cac.png)\r\n\r\n##### Steps to reproduce the problem.\r\nI made a simple GitHub repository that repoduces the problem live.\r\n1) Clone `https://github.com/jack-in-the-box/froala-vs-cypress.git` with git\r\n2) At the root of the produced folder, run `npm run gui` (this installs the dependencies of Cypress and then, runs its GUI)\r\n3) Click on the `froala.spec.js` link:\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1412033/42279968-acb4ba58-7f9f-11e8-8281-07d0296dd8bd.png)\r\n4) Cypress runs the test on Chrome 67 for you\r\n5) The actual routine of the test can be seen on the file `cypress/integration/froala.spec.js`\r\n\r\n##### OS.\r\nAny\r\n\r\n##### Browser.\r\nChrome 67, run by Cypress\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/froala/wysiwyg-editor/issues/2939/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/froala/wysiwyg-editor/issues/2939/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/issues/comments/402615217","html_url":"https://github.com/cypress-io/cypress/issues/2096#issuecomment-402615217","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/issues/2096","id":402615217,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQwMjYxNTIxNw==","user":{"login":"kuceb","id":14625260,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NjI1MjYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14625260?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuceb","html_url":"https://github.com/kuceb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuceb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuceb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuceb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuceb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuceb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuceb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuceb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuceb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuceb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-07-05T06:04:30Z","updated_at":"2018-07-05T06:04:30Z","body":"Hi @e7d This issue will be fixed in an upcoming patch releas